  m_text: "A collection of games in the same universe\n based around a red square
    who platforms.\n\nSQ1 - A simple platformer with collection coins\nSQ2 - A platformer
    with enemies and a sword attack.\nSQW - A upgraded graphics of SQ1 with more
    levels\nSQR - A whole different game with a crafting and upgraded \ncombat system.
    (Abandoned as game wasn't going in right direction)"
